{"name":"Pizza","hex":"#bf8d3c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Pizza","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname from Italian."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Pizza"}],"entries":[{"title":"Pizza","blocks":[{"text":"Pizza is an Italian dish typically consisting of a flat base of leavened wheat-based dough topped with tomato, cheese, and other ingredients, baked at a high temperature, traditionally in a wood-fired oven."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/91/Pizza-3007395.jpg/330px-Pizza-3007395.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pizza","wikidata":"Q177"},{"title":"Pizza (2012 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Pizza is a 2012 Indian Tamil-language horror thriller film directed by Karthik Subbaraj, based on a story he co-wrote with Prasath Kumar and produced by C. V. Kumar under Thirukumaran Entertainment. The film stars Vijay Sethupathi and Remya Nambessan, with Naren, Jayakumar, Karunakaran, Simha and Pooja in supporting roles. It is about a pizza delivery man who goes to a customer's house, but becomes trapped there and begins witnessing paranormal activity."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/b9/Pizza_2012_poster.jpg/330px-Pizza_2012_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pizza_(2012_film)","wikidata":"Q654372"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Pizza_slice.png/500px-Pizza_slice.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Pizza_slice.png/500px-Pizza_slice.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APizza_slice.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56